\newlabel{fig:v5-union-bands}{{37}{65}{Complete 19--250~MeV observed search, with the preassigned active datasets shown above the curves. The upper panel shows 90\% \CLs {} limits and the median, central 68\% and central 95\% ranges of the original 300 conditional background-only toys per mass. The lower panel adds the unchanged fixed-mass asymptotic $p_0$. The observed polyline connects every adjacent tested mass, including membership transitions; no numerical endpoint is changed by those connections. The physical visible-branching correction is applied once above the dimuon threshold. These are pointwise bands; 2016-inclusive values retain the numerical exception.\relax }{figure.caption.49}{}}
